      <memberdef kind="variable" id="structthemis_1_1distributed__knowledge_1_1_federated_r_a_g_merger_config_1a0d7482e1f89555d6fc349ee46b00daa9" prot="public" static="no" mutable="no">
        <type>size_t</type>
        <definition>size_t themis::distributed_knowledge::FederatedRAGMergerConfig::shard_timeout_ms</definition>
        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>shard_timeout_ms</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::distributed_knowledge::FederatedRAGMergerConfig::shard_timeout_ms</qualifiedname>
        <initializer>= std::numeric_limits&lt;size_t&gt;::max()</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Per-shard timeout in milliseconds (DK-OR-T contract). </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Controls timeout handling:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>0: immediate timeout; merge() throws std::runtime_error(&quot;all shards timed out&quot;) if any shard_results passed (fail-closed for safety)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>UINT64_MAX (default): no timeout; all shards always included</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>1..UINT64_MAX-1: custom timeout; shards with timed_out==true are skipped</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><bold>Timeout Contract:</bold><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>merge() checks each <ref refid="structthemis_1_1distributed__knowledge_1_1_shard_retrieval_result_1afa5b372339833639f4c8f369862f7aa7" kindref="member">ShardRetrievalResult.timed_out</ref> flag</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>If timed_out == true and timeout_ms != UINT64_MAX: skip this shard</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>If ALL responding shards timed out: throw std::runtime_error(&quot;all shards timed out&quot;)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Partial timeouts are handled gracefully (merge proceeds with responsive shards) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
        <location file="include/distributed_knowledge/federated_rag_merger.h" line="207" column="19" bodyfile="include/distributed_knowledge/federated_rag_merger.h" bodystart="207" bodyend="-1"/>
