        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Returns true iff:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>top_k &gt; 0</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>rrf_constant &gt; 0.0</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>specialisation_boost &gt;= 1.0 </para>
